      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Invariants",
        "body": "A View may render glyph-shaped artwork without being an icon View. It is still a View representation. Every authored Surface starts with at least one View and ends in its ordinary Glyph; the terminal Glyph does not replace the View.\n\nThe terminal belongs to the selected track. Never select another Surface’s glyph merely because it appears first in the file.",
